category: Libs
requires: cygwin libglib2.0_0
sdesc: "Small library based on GObject that simplifies the creation and managing of child processes (runtime)"
ldesc: "The libgexecutor is a small library, based on GLib2 - GObject, that simplifies
the creation and managing of child processes, for programs based on
glib-GObject."
external-source: libgexecutor

